---
---
<section id="services" class="services section" style="position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="marquee-bg" id="services-marquee">DIGITAL PRO SEO WEB PPC DIGITAL PRO SEO WEB PPC</div>
        <div class="container" style="position: relative; z-index: 2;">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-tag reveal-up">השירותים שלנו</span>
                <h2 class="section-title reveal-up">שלושת הפתרונות <span class="gradient-text">שיקפיצו את העסק</span>
                </h2>
                <p class="section-desc reveal-up text-reveal-scroll">אנחנו מתמחים בשלושה תחומים מרכזיים ומביאים בהם
                    תוצאות יוצאות דופן</p>
            </div>
            <div class="services-grid services-grid-3">
                <!-- Service 1: בניית אתרים -->
                <div class="service-card service-card-featured tilt-card reveal-up" style="--delay: 0.1s">
                    <div class="service-card-inner">
                        <div class="service-card-accent" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #818cf8);">
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-icon-wrap">
                            <div class="service-icon service-icon-lg">
                                <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
                                    <path
                                        d="M5 8C5 6.34315 6.34315 5 8 5H32C33.6569 5 35 6.34315 35 8V28C35 29.6569 33.6569 31 32 31H8C6.34315 31 5 29.6569 5 28V8Z"
                                        stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
                                    <path d="M5 13H35" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
                                    <path d="M15 36H25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
                                    <path d="M20 31V36" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
                                    <circle cx="10" cy="9" r="1.2" fill="currentColor" />
                                    <circle cx="14" cy="9" r="1.2" fill="currentColor" />
                                    <circle cx="18" cy="9" r="1.2" fill="currentColor" />
                                    <path d="M12 19L16 23L12 27" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                    <path d="M20 27H28" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="service-title">בניית אתרים</h3>
                        <p class="service-desc">בניית אתרים מותאמים אישית עם טכנולוגיות מתקדמות. אתרי תדמית, חנויות
                            אונליין, מערכות ניהול, דפי נחיתה ועוד - הכל בעיצוב מרהיב וביצועים יוצאי דופן.</p>
                        <ul class="service-features">
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>עיצוב רספונסיבי מושלם לכל מכשיר</span>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>מהירות טעינה מטורפת ו-Core Web Vitals</span>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>מערכת ניהול תוכן קלה לתפעול</span>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>אבטחה מתקדמת ו-SSL מובנה</span>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>אינטגרציה עם מערכות חיצוניות</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="service-tags">
                            <span class="service-tag">React</span>
                            <span class="service-tag">Next.js</span>
                            <span class="service-tag">WordPress</span>
                            <span class="service-tag">Shopify</span>
                            <span class="service-tag">Node.js</span>
                        </div>
                        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm service-cta">
                            <span class="btn-text">רוצה אתר חדש? דברו איתנו</span>
                            <span class="btn-icon">
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8H13M13 8L9 4M13 8L9 12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                            </span>
                            <span class="btn-shine"></span>
                        </a>
                        <div class="service-card-glow"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 2: קידום אורגני SEO -->
                <div class="service-card service-card-featured tilt-card reveal-up" style="--delay: 0.25s">
                    <div class="service-card-inner">
                        <div class="service-card-accent" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #06b6d4, #22d3ee);">
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-icon-wrap">
                            <div class="service-icon service-icon-lg">
                                <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
                                    <circle cx="17" cy="17" r="11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
                                    <path d="M26 26L35 35" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" />
                                    <path d="M12 17H22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
                                    <path d="M17 12V22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
                                    <path d="M11 13L14 17L11 21" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.4" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="service-title">קידום אורגני SEO</h3>
                        <p class="service-desc">אסטרטגיית SEO מקיפה שמביאה את האתר שלך למקומות הראשונים בגוגל. מחקר
                            מילות מפתח, אופטימיזציה טכנית, בניית קישורים ותוכן שעובד.</p>
                        <ul class="service-features">
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>מחקר מילות מפתח מעמיק ומדויק</span>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>אופטימיזציית On-Page ו-Technical SEO</span>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>בניית קישורים איכותיים (Link Building)</span>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>כתיבת תוכן SEO ממוקד המרות</span>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>דוחות ביצועים חודשיים מפורטים</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="service-tags">
                            <span class="service-tag">Google Search Console</span>
                            <span class="service-tag">Ahrefs</span>
                            <span class="service-tag">SEMrush</span>
                            <span class="service-tag">Schema</span>
                        </div>
                        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm service-cta">
                            <span class="btn-text">רוצים להגיע לעמוד 1?</span>
                            <span class="btn-icon">
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8H13M13 8L9 4M13 8L9 12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                            </span>
                            <span class="btn-shine"></span>
                        </a>
                        <div class="service-card-glow"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Service 3: פרסום ממומן PPC -->
                <div class="service-card service-card-featured tilt-card reveal-up" style="--delay: 0.4s">
                    <div class="service-card-inner">
                        <div class="service-card-accent" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e, #fb7185);">
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-icon-wrap">
                            <div class="service-icon service-icon-lg">
                                <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none">
                                    <rect x="5" y="10" width="30" height="22" rx="3" stroke="currentColor"
                                        stroke-width="2" />
                                    <path d="M5 17H35" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
                                    <path d="M12 24H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
                                    <path d="M23 24H28" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
                                    <path d="M14 5L12 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" />
                                    <path d="M26 5L28 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" />
                                    <circle cx="30" cy="14" r="1" fill="currentColor" />
                                    <path d="M12 28H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"
                                        opacity="0.4" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="service-title">פרסום ממומן PPC</h3>
                        <p class="service-desc">ניהול קמפיינים ממומנים בגוגל אדס, פייסבוק ואינסטגרם שמביאים לידים
                            איכותיים ומכירות עם ROI מקסימלי ותוצאות מדידות.</p>
                        <ul class="service-features">
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>ניהול Google Ads (חיפוש, שופינג, דיספליי)</span>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>קמפיינים ב-Facebook & Instagram Ads</span>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>אופטימיזציית המרות ו-A/B Testing</span>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>רימרקטינג ופילוח קהלים מתקדם</span>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8L6.5 11.5L13 4.5" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                                <span>מעקב ROI שקוף ודוחות בזמן אמת</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="service-tags">
                            <span class="service-tag">Google Ads</span>
                            <span class="service-tag">Meta Ads</span>
                            <span class="service-tag">Analytics</span>
                            <span class="service-tag">GTM</span>
                        </div>
                        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm service-cta">
                            <span class="btn-text">רוצים לידים? מתחילים!</span>
                            <span class="btn-icon">
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
                                    <path d="M3 8H13M13 8L9 4M13 8L9 12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                                </svg>
                            </span>
                            <span class="btn-shine"></span>
                        </a>
                        <div class="service-card-glow"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>